[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6308.709, "timestamp": "01:45:08", "text": "ADM類型的音樂"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6328.797, "timestamp": "01:45:28", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ah what happened to dream huh"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6333.03, "timestamp": "01:45:33", "text": "，因為它的規則和編曲方面太繁瑣了。這裡需要加入一些節奏感。前奏部分必須有四小節或八小節。這裡需要加裝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6352.39, "timestamp": "01:45:52", "text": "一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6354.629, "timestamp": "01:45:54", "text": "墊高器。這個那個。然後每當我開始聽 Porter Robinson 的新專輯，以及他用這種不同的音樂創作方式（不太像 EDM 類型）改變了整個 EDM 場景時，我就會想：是的，那啟發了我，讓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6358.87, "timestamp": "01:45:58", "text": "我覺得不總是遵守規則是件"}]